#: polyhost/gui/settings_dialog.py:416
msgid "Watches the messages the keyboard sends over USB for known failures, and offers to report a problem."
msgstr ""

#: polyhost/gui/settings_dialog.py:419
msgid "Watches this app's own log for known failure messages, and offers to report a problem."
